      ["What does 'I couldn't understand the question' mean?", ["I must understand the question.", "Eu não consegui entender a pergunta.", "I may understand the question.", "Eu consigo entender a pergunta."], 1, "'Couldn't' is the negative form of 'could' and expresses inability in the past."],
      ["Read: 'You may leave after the lesson.' What does 'may' express?", ["Past ability", "Impossibility", "Permission", "Obligation"], 2, "In this sentence, 'may' grants permission to leave after the lesson."]
